{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36987","headline":"送陆郎中赴阙 · 罗隐","name":"送陆郎中赴阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幕下留连两月强，炉边侍史旧焚香。\n不关雨露偏垂意，自是鸳鸾合着行。\n三署履声通建礼，九霄星彩映明光。\n少瑜镂管丘迟锦，从此西垣使凤凰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36987.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36987","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}